  ForeverWeaponRack key commands.
  The add-on binds your set keys and the Equipment Toggle key to these
  commands with override bindings (see Bindings.lua). A key press runs the
  command's code directly, which is what lets swaps happen in combat.
  They are hidden from the game's Key Bindings window: set keys in the
  add-on (Edit Set tab, Key box) and the toggle key in its Settings.
  The number of KEY entries must match Bindings.MAX_KEYS in Bindings.lua.
-->
